  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-tokens",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 620,
      "text": "Everything on these three boards is a CSS custom property in design/tokens.css \u2014 colours, space, radii, type sizes, leading, measure, clock thresholds, motion.\n\nDark is not an inversion: only the aliases move. The neutral ramp and every scale stay exactly where they are."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 620,
      "text": "Four screens, one vocabulary. Exam mode is shown dark to check the 90-minute case; every board has a light/dark tweak above it.\n\nQuestions, options and explanations are real content from exams/exam-01 in this repo \u2014 not placeholder copy."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-phone",
      "page": "page-3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -210,
      "w": 620,
      "text": "Same tokens, different layout. The 60-tile navigator cannot live in a rail at 390px, so it becomes a sheet you pull up from the question counter.\n\nEvery touch target is at least 44x44 (--control-h-lg), including the navigator tiles, which go from 34px to 44px. The 34px tile is a pointer-only size."
    }
  ],
